<title>FRANCE: Cr Lyonnais mulls asset management sale.</title>
<headline>Cr Lyonnais mulls asset management sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French state bank Credit Lyonnais said in reply to a query it was in talks with a U.S. group which could lead to the sale of all or part of the capital of Credit Lyonnais Asset Management.</p>
<p>&quot;The issue is being considered with an American partner. It could lead to us selling all or a part of the capital of Credit Lyonnais Asset Management but nothing is decided at this stage,&quot; a Credit Lyonnais spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>The spokesman declined to name the U.S. group the bank is talking to about the possible sale of Credit Lyonnais Asset Management, which is based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
